 "brief": "Israeli occupation forces arrested 21 Palestinians across four West Bank governorates on Sunday morning, Shehab Wire reported. The detainees, taken from Bethlehem, Jenin, Tulkarm, and Hebron, included former prisoners. The arrests occurred during what the agency described as widespread incursions across the territory.\n\nA Palestinian man sustained moderate injuries during a raid on a home in Qabatiya, a town south of Jenin.",
